						<span style="color:#097c98;font-size:10;">WHAT OUR CLIENTS SAY:</span> 
					</apex:outputText>
					<apex:outputText >
						<span style="font-size:10px;">"DCS consultants know programs like Salesforce.com better than almost anyone. When we need to solve yet another business challenge, I rely on their understanding of Salesforce to help plan our strategy for implementation, and to understand what the roadmap to completing the integration with Salesforce will look like. They've become a trusted partner in our use of technology to support our sales organization,¿ said Tracy Peloquin, Ebusiness Manager, North America Commercial Division, Imation Corp.</span> 
